pageType: content
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 34, 300, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: 05 · 核心机制}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 840, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 防重复融资：登记查重、托管锁定、转让限制三道闸
  - elementId: rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 102, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: g1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 132, 240, 60]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:34px;color:$accent"><strong>闸口一</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>登记查重 · InvoiceRegistry</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: g1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 216, 240, 170]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 合约按「发票号 + 买方 + 卖方 + 金额」生成去重键。同组合再次提交时直接 revert：InvoiceAlreadyExists，交易不会上链。
  - elementId: vline1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [330, 132, 1, 260]
    viewBox: [1, 260]
    points: "0,0 0,260"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: g2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 132, 240, 60]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:34px;color:$accent"><strong>闸口二</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>托管锁定 · FinancingPool</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: g2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [360, 216, 240, 170]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 申请融资时凭证自动转入池子托管，同一份额无法同时挂在两个申请下——双花质押在合约层被物理阻止。
  - elementId: vline2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [630, 132, 1, 260]
    viewBox: [1, 260]
    points: "0,0 0,260"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: g3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 132, 240, 60]
    content:
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:34px;color:$accent"><strong>闸口三</strong></span></p>
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>转让限制 · ReceivableToken</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: g3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 216, 240, 170]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: 资金方受让凭证后不可再转让，只能持有至兑付，杜绝「同一凭证多层转卖重复融资」。
  - elementId: bottom-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [60, 420, 840, 1]
    viewBox: [840, 1]
    points: "0,0 840,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: bottom
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 438, 840, 44]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p>不误杀的细节：发票被拒绝后合约<strong>释放去重键</strong>，供应商改正信息后可原号重提；逾期后仍可付款，状态由 Overdue 回到 Repaid。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 508, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", wrap: false, text: SC6113 · 供应链金融 DApp}
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 508, 40, 18]
    content: {style: "$small", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "06"}
